!TemplateSample
Id: 9F3B7C21-5D4E-4A8B-B2C6-1E7D8F9A0B3C
Name: "Sample: voxel terrain"
Scope: Session
Description: A kilometre of procedural voxel terrain drawn without a mesh, dug into, lit by voxel GI
FullDescription: This sample evaluates a landscape on the GPU into nested rings of voxel grids around the camera, draws them with the voxel grid renderer (no meshing, no chunks), collides against the finest ring with the voxel collider, injects the field into the voxel cone tracing GI, and lets you dig and fill it in real time.
Group: Samples/Graphics
Icon: .sdtpl/Icon.png
DefaultOutputName: VoxelTerrain
Screenshots:
    - .sdtpl/screenshot_small.png
